            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article contains materials on diagnosis of shoulder soft tissue diseases. To diagnose compression syndrome of humeral rotators, the authors used clinical and diagnostic complex including ultrasound of shoulder joints. Using this diagnostic complex enables early diagnosis of this disease and determine severity of changes in tissues surrounding shoulder joints.</AbstractText>
